title: Door3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's door (Hotspots layer). It opens with the actions here: a
// popup when several are available, the only one at once. Each picks by chapter and gates.
-> Knock <<if $chapter == "R1MoveIn" and not $gate_r1_move_keys>>
    <<next_scene Route1MoveInKeys>>
-> Knock <<if $chapter == "R1Sunday" and not $gate_r1_sun_croissant>>
    <<if not $gate_r1_sun_text>>
        You: My phone's buzzing. Her, probably. Read it first.
    <<elseif not $item_bakery_bag>>
        // Behind her door.
        {$samantha_name}: ...Where's my croissant?
    <<else>>
        <<next_scene Route1Croissant>>
    <<endif>>
-> Knock <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and not $gate_r1_thu1_door>>
    <<if not $gate_r1_thu1_text>>
        You: She texted. I should read it first.
    <<else>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu1Door>>
    <<endif>>
-> Knock <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door>>
    <<if not $gate_r1_thu2_text>>
        You: Her text first.
    <<elseif $item_wine_fox>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu2Door>>
    <<elseif $item_wine_reserve>>
        You: The gold label. She said not that one.
    <<elseif $item_wine_house>>
        You: The house red. She'd know.
    <<else>>
        You: Empty-handed? Bring what she'd want. The shop's downstairs.
    <<endif>>
-> Take my shoes off <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_door and not $gate_r1_thu2_shoes>>
    <<next_scene Route1Thu2Shoes>>
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        You: Not this one. The listing said 3B.
    <<else>>
        You: 3A. Her door. The doormat doesn't say welcome.
    <<endif>>
===
